  "details": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cH0qllXbu4Q\n\nSetup: <image shows this>\n\nTest Avatar: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_01fcf4c7-f574-4070-ba53-3e91c4a8dec5\n\n1. Humanoid Rig\n\n2. World constraint parent constraint. Locked to only Y axis\n\n3. Child of above parent constraint locked all\n\n4. Cube for visualization child of above\n\nWhat should happen:\n\nWhen the container is disabled the cube no longer moves and stays in place on both clients.\n\nThe constrainted object is 1:1 (minus delay) with both clients. \n\nWhat happens instead:\n\nThe remote client will see the cube begin to move up and down on the Y axis during a player rotation while local client saw the cube not moving as intended.",
